Model weights
-------------
No neural model weights are included in this repository. The chord engines load
weights that each user downloads or exports locally from the original authors'
releases, under those authors' licences:

- Crema (https://github.com/bmcfee/crema), BSD-2-Clause; ONNX conversion from
  TuneForge (https://github.com/grazzolini/tuneforge), MIT.
- LV Song / lv-chordia (https://github.com/openmirlab/lv-chordia), MIT.
- Consonance (https://github.com/andreamust/consonance-ACE), MIT.
- solitito-ai (https://github.com/greblus/solitito-ai), MIT.
- ChordMini ChordNet and BTC (https://github.com/ptnghia-j/ChordMini): code MIT, but
  the training data includes non-commercial material. Personal use only.
- anime-song Chord-Transcription (https://github.com/anime-song/Chord-Transcription):
  the weights are marked MIT on the model card, but the code has no licence. Personal
  use only until the author confirms.
- ChordFormer (https://github.com/mwaseemrandhawa/ChordFormer): no licence. Its
  exported files are never committed here. Personal research use only.

GuitarSet (CC BY 4.0)
---------------------
PitchKit/src/test/resources/solitito-parity-audio.s16 is a three-second excerpt of one
GuitarSet recording, stored as raw 16-bit PCM for use as a regression fixture. No
other change was made.

GuitarSet: Qingyang Xi, Rachel M. Bittner, Johan Pauwels, Xuzhou Ye and Juan Pablo
Bello, "GuitarSet: A Dataset for Guitar Transcription", ISMIR 2018.
https://guitarset.weebly.com/ - https://zenodo.org/record/3371780
